OL,3,AProtesters call on Israel to free
OL,4,APalestinian student held without charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli students, activists and
OL,7,Facademics are calling for the release
OL,8,Fof a Palestinian undergraduate who was
OL,9,Ftaken from his university dormitory by
OL,10,FIsraeli police earlier this month and
OL,11,Fhas since been held without charge.
OL,13,FMahdi Tunsi, a 26-year-old sociology
OL,14,Fand criminology student at the Hebrew
OL,15,FUniversity of Jerusalem, appeared in an
OL,16,FIsraeli court in the city on Tuesday -
OL,17,Fa hearing that was held behind closed
OL,18,Fdoors.
OL,20,FIsraeli police say he was arrested
OL,21,F"concerning ties to an act of
OL,22,Fterrorism".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
