OL,3,AProtesters call on Israel to free
OL,4,APalestinian student held without charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities have requested what is
OL,7,Fknown as "administrative detention",
OL,8,Fwhich allows the Israeli state to
OL,9,Fdetain people indefinitely without
OL,10,Fcharge on the basis of secret evidence
OL,11,Fthat they cannot see.
